### ============================================
### Garden API Test Cases
### Base URL: http://localhost:5262
### ============================================

### 1. Register new user (Farmer role)
POST http://localhost:5262/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "farmer1@test.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "roleId": 4
}

### 2. Verify OTP (use OTP from email)
POST http://localhost:5262/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "farmer1@test.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Save the accessToken from response above
@accessToken = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### GARDEN CRUD TESTS
### ============================================

### 3. CREATE GARDEN (POST /api/gardens)
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Vườn Nhãn Lồng Hưng Yên",
  "location": "123 Đường Nguyễn Văn Linh, Xã Minh Tân, Huyện Kim Động, Tỉnh Hưng Yên"
}

### 4. CREATE GARDEN - Tên ngắn
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Vườn Xoài Cát Hòa Lộc",
  "location": "Đồng Tháp"
}

### 5. CREATE GARDEN - Không có location
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Vườn Cam Sành Cao Phong"
}

### 6. CREATE GARDEN - Validation Error (tên quá ngắn)
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "AB",
  "location": "Test"
}

### 7. CREATE GARDEN - Validation Error (tên quá dài)
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua ut enim ad minim veniam quis nostrud",
  "location": "Test"
}

### 8. CREATE GARDEN - Missing required field (name)
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "location": "Test Location"
}

### ============================================
### GET GARDENS LIST
### ============================================

### 9. GET all gardens (default pagination)
GET http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. GET gardens with pagination
GET http://localhost:5262/api/gardens?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. GET gardens with search
GET http://localhost:5262/api/gardens?searchTerm=nhãn
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. GET gardens with search + pagination
GET http://localhost:5262/api/gardens?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&searchTerm=vườn
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### GET GARDEN DETAIL
### ============================================

### 13. GET garden by ID (replace {id} with actual garden ID)
GET http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. GET garden by ID - Not Found
GET http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### UPDATE GARDEN
### ============================================

### 15. UPDATE garden - Change name and location
PUT http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Vườn Nhãn Lồng Hưng Yên (Đã cập nhật)",
  "location": "456 Đường Lê Lợi, Hưng Yên (Địa chỉ mới)"
}

### 16. UPDATE garden - Only name
PUT http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Vườn Nhãn Lồng Premium"
}

### 17. UPDATE garden - Only location
PUT http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "location": "Hà Nội, Việt Nam"
}

### 18. UPDATE garden - Clear location
PUT http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "location": ""
}

### 19. UPDATE garden - Validation error (name too short)
PUT http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "VN"
}

### 20. UPDATE garden - Not owner (403 Forbidden)
# First create another user and try to update garden of user 1
PUT http://localhost:5262/api/gardens/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ANOTHER_USER_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Hacker's Garden"
}

### ============================================
### ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### 21. CREATE garden without authentication (401)
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Garden",
  "location": "Test"
}

### 22. GET gardens without authentication (401)
GET http://localhost:5262/api/gardens

### 23. CREATE garden with Staff role (403 Forbidden)
# Register as Staff (RoleId = 3), then try to create garden
POST http://localhost:5262/api/gardens
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer STAFF_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Staff Garden",
  "location": "Should fail"
}
